{
  "Npcs.SharkMan.Desc": "Hulking with power, the shark man ahead of you is at least [if (metric) {a hundred and eighty centimeters|six feet}] tall, covered in gray and white skin, with a frazzled head of silver hair. Adorning his well-toned form are tattoos and accessories, with the most lavish-looking charm being a ruby-encrusted ring around one of his dual cocks. You might hazard a guess that he's in his fifties, but age hardly diminishes him. He is armed with a broken chain."
  "Npcs.SharkMan.Name": "shark man"
}
